{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id664108368"}, "name":{"label":"Something.Or.Someone"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-07-09T17:56:10-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.0.3"}, "id":{"label":"14284149128"}, "title":{"label":"Needs improvements"}, "content":{"label":"I am using this App and website while I’m going through brain surgery. The website is great, but the app has room for improvement. 1) you can’t see the full calendar. 2) you can’t choose what notifications you get and what notifications you don’t get (like I want to only be notified of pending requests not when people volunteer for something. But that’s not an option). 3) There’s not a way on the app or the website to make a reoccurring task (not just duplicating it but also a way to say “every Monday 7-11am indefinitely). 4) Also, it would be nice on the website and App Calendar if there are multiple tasks in a day but only some tasks have a volunteer and some don’t, for it to be striped grey and pink instead of remaining pink.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=606923858&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
