{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id21370242"}, "name":{"label":"JFlytunes"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-04-19T04:47:59-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.5"}, "id":{"label":"9838002259"}, "title":{"label":"Almost there!"}, "content":{"label":"LHH checks alot of boxes in that it has a robust desktop browser version for Admins. However the App is  missing ONE key feature: CALENDAR VIEW!Currently, (as of April 2023) the only way I can view All tasks and needs is in a List view. This makes it difficult for Volunteers to get an overview of needs. \n\nThere is a Calendart Icon at the top of the List view however it DOES NOTHING. Please, LHH - implement a Calendar View on the App!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=606923858&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"4"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"4"}}, 
