{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id29999335"}, "name":{"label":"Ahroon"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-03-02T22:56:28-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.0.8"}, "id":{"label":"1556304882"}, "title":{"label":"Not useful for Coordinating"}, "content":{"label":"As some people who reviewed the last version pointed out, this app is for people volunteering to help, not for the person coordinating the help. Who do they think are the main people downloading this app? They should consider it's the coordinators who will be using it most while sitting in hospital rooms trying g to approve members, add activities, and manage caretaking on-the-go. It's a shame since the website is head and shoulders above others of its class. As it is, I can only use this app to see who signed up for a meal drop off on what day. Or post an announcement. I'll have to keep checking email to approve new members, then open a web browser on my phone, and re-sign in, yet again, to manage that. I \"get\" to use safari instead of this app if I want to edit an event or even create a new activity on the calendar. If the app were useful for coordinating I would be telling everyone about LotsaHelpingHands. Please, for the sake of your brand, try to fix these problems with the app!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=606923858&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
